<title>USA: IntraNet Solutions sets reverse split.</title>
<headline>IntraNet Solutions sets reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>IntraNet Solutions Inc said Wednesday its board of directors had declared a one-for-four reverse stock split. The record date for the split is October 31.</p>
<p>As a result of the reverse split, IntraNet Solutions will have 7,440,606 common shares outstanding.  </p>
<p>IntraNet Solutions assists large companies in designing and implementing integrated solutions to manage and distribute information.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
